    "title": "Music Player - MP3 Player",
    "description": "Intuitive, user-friendly and countless music player features from standard to high-end are what Music player has made a strong impression on users since the very first days of its release.\r\nDownload Music player to scan and play music with amazing sound quality of all popular audio formats like mp3, wav, flac, acc etc. With Music player - Mp3 player media player, it's very easy for you to listen to all the songs in your phone by folder, album, artist, genre. In particular, this free music app also allows you to create your own playlists so that you can freely enjoy your favorite songs.\r\nWith Music player - Mp3 player, you can easily manage your songs like search, sort playlists and tons of cool customizations of a professional music player like shuffle, repeat, add picture for song, cut music, make ringtones, sleep timer mode.\r\nLyrics. The application supports powerful song search, automatically displays the corresponding results and easily adds and edits lyrics offline.\r\nBesides, application to listen to music - music player also has many useful features such as a powerful equalizer with 5 frequency band with bass feature and virtualization function, audio fade in transition, custom audio output according to music genres as well as integrating many beautiful color themes, wallpaper options from photos and change flexible interface will enhance your music listening experience.\r\n<b>Main features:</b>\r\n-\tFree-music can quick scan, find and display all the songs on your phone.\r\n-\tFree offline music player supports all the most popular music file formats: mp3, wma, wav, flac, aiff, aac\u2026\r\n-\tFree music app can scan and play music by album, artist, song, playlist, folder.\r\n-\tFree offline music player, mp3 player, audio player can browse and listen to audio books\r\n-\tCreate playlists and add songs to listen to music\r\n-\tFree music player can play music by favorite playlist, most played list, recent playlist\r\n-\tProfessional 5-band powerful equalizer\r\n-\tOffline music-player can play music in the background\r\n-\tMusic player supports headphone and bluetooth\r\n-\tPreset your music style (Normal, Classic, Dance, Flat, Folk, Heavy Metal, Hip hop, Jazz, Pop, Rock...)\r\n-\tManage songs easily, search, delete, share songs\r\n-\tFree-music can play music in sequence, shuffle, repeat\r\n-\tFree offline music player supports features editing lyrics, edit audio\r\n-\tChange avatars for songs, playlists, folders, artists, albums, genres\r\n-\tIntegrate a variety of music playing themes by color, optional album wallpapers, gradients\r\n-\tMusic player application that supports setting phone ringtones\r\n-\tOption to display as list or grid\r\n-\tThe free music player application supports timer to play music, rewind music at will\r\n-\tFree music app can shake phone to change song\r\nIn addition, this music app can listen to music from device. You can easily listen to music from the app.\r\nWhat are you waiting for, download Music player to listen to top-notch music to your phone and experience it together. A great application for moments of entertainment after school or stressful work.\r\nMusic is endless, download Music player - Mp3 player to enjoy free mp3 music player anytime, anywhere, listening to music is extremely convenient. Loads of great music features and free powerful equalizer make Music player the perfect replacement for the default music player.",
